## Dimension 3: Security

### Applicable Guardrails
- **AUTH-004:** Authorization Required — confidentiality change and override endpoints require valid JWT with appropriate role scope; patient visibility change requires appropriate role scope
- **SEC-001:** TLS Encryption — all confidentiality settings transmitted over TLS 1.2+

### Security Requirements
- Confidentiality override action restricted to users with an elevated role (as defined by EMIS Web policy); not available to all users
- Patient online visibility change restricted to users with appropriate clinical or administrative authority
- Confidentiality policy enforcement performed server-side; client-supplied confidentiality overrides validated against user role before being accepted
- Policy resolution from EMIS Web authenticated; not open to manipulation via unauthenticated requests

