## Dimension 4: Observability & Performance

### KPIs
- Confidentiality override rate (frequency of overrides — anomalous spikes may indicate misuse)
- Patient online visibility change rate
- Confidentiality policy resolution success rate (EMIS Web policy retrieved successfully)
- Policy resolution latency

### OTEL Spans
- `documents.confidentiality.set` — document marked confidential
- `documents.confidentiality.overridden` — confidentiality policy overridden; before/after state recorded
- `documents.visibility.patient_set` — patient online visibility changed; new state recorded
- `documents.confidentiality.policy_resolved` — EMIS Web confidentiality policy successfully retrieved
- `documents.confidentiality.policy_failed` — EMIS Web policy retrieval failed; fallback to most restrictive applied

### SLOs
- Confidentiality policy resolution: p95 < 500ms
- Confidentiality change audit write: p99 before change takes effect
- Policy resolution success rate: ≥ 99.9% (failure triggers fail-closed behaviour)

