## PxD (Added by V1d)

> **Scope: Full PxD.** UI surfaces: Confidentiality and Online Visibility controls embedded in the Step 2 Filing form (REQ-012 PxD — cross-reference); standalone confidentiality status indicator in document list row and viewer; override flow for authorised roles. Prototype: `.conf-group` CSS block in Filing panel (lines 434–453).

