### User Flow

**Primary Flow — Set confidentiality at filing (Step 2):**
1. Confidentiality and online visibility selects are presented as a grouped section within the Step 2 filing form (see REQ-012 PxD)
2. Both default to most restrictive option (Standard access / Not visible to patient) — fail-closed
3. Admin changes only if clinically appropriate; `Banner variant="warning"` appears on any change from default
4. Values saved with document on "File document →"

**Alternative Flow — Override confidentiality post-filing (authorised role):**
1. Authorised admin opens a filed document in viewer
2. Confidentiality status badge visible in Protocol Panel or document header
3. Admin clicks "Change confidentiality" (role-gated; only shown to authorised roles)
4. Confirmation `Dialog` opens: shows current and proposed setting; states audit event will be recorded
5. Admin confirms → value saved; audit event recorded (before/after values); `Notification variant="success"`

**Exit Types:**
- Save (filing step): confidentiality saved with document
- Cancel (override): dialog closed; no change
- Confirm (override): new value saved; audit event recorded

